Package: PanFamR
Title: Pan-Cancer ssGSEA Analysis and Visualization
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Serena", email = "g512827252@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Calculates single-sample gene set enrichment scores and provides
    functions for pan-cancer expression, survival, mutation, and immune
    association analyses and visualizations. Includes bundled TCGA/GTEx
    expression, clinical, and supporting analysis datasets, and accepts
    user-defined gene sets for ssGSEA scoring.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
URL: https://github.com/JianGao0852/PanFamR
